s/operators/basics/consensus-staking/"><div class="megaMenuItemContent"><span class="megaMenuItemLabel">Handbook</span><span class="megaMenuItemDescription">Step by step from setup to governance</span></div></a></li><li class="megaMenuItem"><a class="megaMenuItemLink" href="/docs/operators/operator-tools/guild-ops-suite/"><div class="megaMenuItemContent"><span class="megaMenuItemLabel">Operator Tools</span><span class="megaMenuItemDescription">Guild Ops, Calidus keys, and Mithril</span></div></a></li></ul></div></div></div></li><li class="navbar__item navbar__item--mega" data-column-count="2"><button class="navbar__link megaMenuTrigger" type="button">Ecosystem</button><div class="megaMenuPanel"><div class="megaMenuInner"><div class="megaMenuColumn"><div class="megaMenuColumnTitle"><img src="/img/icons/shapes-solid.svg" alt="" class="megaMenuColumnIcon" aria-hidden="true">Explore</div><ul class="megaMenuColumnList"><li class="megaMenuItem"><a class="megaMenuItemLink" href="/blog/"><div class="megaMenuItemContent"><span class="megaMenuItemLabel">Dev Blog</span><span class="megaMenuItemDescription">Latest developer updates</span></div></a></li><li class="megaMenuItem"><a href="https://www.addevent.com/calendar/TG807216" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="megaMenuItemLink"><div class="megaMenuItemContent"><span class="megaMenuItemLabel">Developer Office Hours</span><span class="megaMenuItemDescription">Weekly live Q&amp;A with Cardano Foundation engineers</span></div></a></li></ul></div><div class="megaMenuColumn"><div class="megaMenuColumnTitle"><img src="/img/icons/link-solid.svg" alt="" class="megaMenuColumnIcon" aria-hidden="true">External Resources</div><ul class="megaMenuColumnList"><li class="megaMenuItem"><a href="https://cardanoupdates.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="megaMenuItemLink"><div class="megaMenuItemContent"><span class="megaMenuItemLabel">Developer Activity</span><span class="megaMenuItemDescription">Track ecosystem-wide development progress</span></div></a></li><li class="megaMenuItem"><a href="https://cips.cardano.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="megaMenuItemLink"><div class="megaMenuItemContent"><span class="megaMenuItemLabel">CIPs</span><span class="megaMenuItemDescription">Cardano Improvement Proposals</span></div></a></li></ul></div></div></div></li></div><div class="theme-layout-navbar-right navbar__items navbar__items--right"><a href="https://discord.gg/MmeqpAzKbp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="navbar__item navbar__link header-discord-link" aria-label="Engineering and Development Discord"></a><a href="https://github.com/cardano-foundation/developer-portal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="navbar__item navbar__link header-github-link" aria-label="GitHub repository"></a><div class="toggle_vylO colorModeToggle_DEke"><button class="clean-btn toggleButton_gllP toggleButtonDisabled_aARS" type="button" disabled="" title="system mode" aria-label="Switch between dark and light mode (currently system mode)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="toggleIcon_g3eP lightToggleIcon_pyhR"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12,9c1.65,0,3,1.35,3,3s-1.35,3-3,3s-3-1.35-3-3S10.35,9,12,9 M12,7c-2.76,0-5,2.24-5,5s2.24,5,5,5s5-2.24,5-5 S14.76,7,12,7L12,7z M2,13l2,0c0.55,0,1-0.45,1-1s-0.45-1-1-1l-2,0c-0.55,0-1,0.45-1,1S1.45,13,2,13z M20,13l2,0c0.55,0,1-0.45,1-1 s-0.45-1-1-1l-2,0c-0.55,0-1,0.45-1,1S19.45,13,20,13z M11,2v2c0,0.55,0.45,1,1,1s1-0.45,1-1V2c0-0.55-0.45-1-1-1S11,1.45,11,2z M11,20v2c0,0.55,0.45,1,1,1s1-0.45,1-1v-2c0-0.55-0.45-1-1-1C11.45,19,11,19.45,11,20z M5.99,4.58c-0.39-0.39-1.03-0.39-1.41,0 c-0.39,0.39-0.39,1.03,0,1.41l1.06,1.06c0.39,0.39,1.03,0.39,1.41,0s0.39-1.03,0-1.41L5.99,4.58z M18.36,16.95 c-0.39-0.39-1.03-0.39-1.41,0c-0.39,0.39-0.39,1.03,0,1.41l1.06,1.06c0.39,0.39,1.03,0.39,1.41,0c0.39-0.39,0.39-1.03,0-1.41 L18.36,16.95z M19.42,5.99c0.39-0.39,0.39-1.03,0-1.41c-0.39-0.39-1.03-0.39-1.41,0l-1.06,1.06c-0.39,0.39-0.39,1.03,0,1.41 s1.03,0.39,1.41,0L19.42,5.99z M7.05,18.36c0.39-0.39,0.39-1.03,0-1.41c-0.39-0.39-1.03-0.39-1.41,0l-1.06,1.06 c-0.39,0.39-0.39,1.03,0,1.41s1.03,0.39,1.41,0L7.05,18.36z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="toggleIcon_g3eP darkToggleIcon_wfgR"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9.37,5.51C9.19,6.15,9.1,6.82,9.1,7.5c0,4.08,3.32,7.4,7.4,7.4c0.68,0,1.35-0.09,1.99-0.27C17.45,17.19,14.93,19,12,19 c-3.86,0-7-3.14-7-7C5,9.07,6.81,6.55,9.37,5.51z M12,3c-4.97,0-9,4.03-9,9s4.03,9,9,9s9-4.03,9-9c0-0.46-0.04-0.92-0.1-1.36 c-0.98,1.37-2.58,2.26-4.4,2.26c-2.98,0-5.4-2.42-5.4-5.4c0-1.81,0.89-3.42,2.26-4.4C12.92,3.04,12.46,3,12,3L12,3z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="toggleIcon_g3eP systemToggleIcon_QzmC"><path fill="currentColor" d="m12 21c4.971 0 9-4.029 9-9s-4.029-9-9-9-9 4.029-9 9 4.029 9 9 9zm4.95-13.95c1.313 1.313 2.05 3.093 2.05 4.95s-0.738 3.637-2.05 4.95c-1.313 1.313-3.093 2.05-4.95 2.05v-14c1.857 0 3.637 0.737 4.95 2.05z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="navbarSearchContainer_Bca1"><button type="button" class="DocSearch DocSearch-Button" aria-label="Search (Meta+k)" aria-keyshortcuts="Meta+k"><span class="DocSearch-Button-Container"><svg width="20" height="20" class="DocSearch-Search-Icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.4"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="DocSearch-Button-Placeholder">Search</span></span><span class="DocSearch-Button-Keys"></span></button></div></div></div><div role="presentation" class="navbar-sidebar__backdrop"></div></nav><div id="__docusaurus_skipToContent_fallback" class="theme-layout-main main-wrapper mainWrapper_z2l0"><header class="hero hero--primary heroBannerStarburst_WhTQ"><div class="container"><div class="backgroundBox_r25G"><div class="taglineContainer_Yesg"><h1 class="hero__title">Builder Tools</h1><p class="hero__subtitle">Discover developer tools, SDKs, and libraries for building on Cardano. Smart contracts, transactions, indexing, wallets, and more.</p></div><div class="sectionCaret"><svg x="0px" y="0px" viewBox="0 0 2000 30"><polygon points="1000,30 0,30 0,0 980,0 "></polygon><polygon points="1000,30 2000,30 2000,0 1020,0 "></polygon></svg></div></div></div></header><section class="intentSection_PlyL" aria-labelledby="tools-intent-title"><div class="container"><h2 id="tools-intent-title" class="intentTitle_Q2hi">I want to</h2><ul class="intentList_hdgn"><li class="intentItem_iN_J"><button type="button" class="intentChip_Xc08" aria-pressed="false">Write smart contracts<svg class="infoDot_Rp8K" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="13" height="13" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="4.7" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle><rect x="7.2" y="6.8" width="1.6" height="4.8" rx="0.8" fill="currentColor"></rect></svg></button></li><li class="intentItem_iN_J"><button type="button" class="intentChip_Xc08" aria-pressed="false">Build transactions<svg class="infoDot_Rp8K" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="13" height="13" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="4.7" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle><rect x="7.2" y="6.8" width="1.6" height="4.8" rx="0.8" fill="currentColor"></rect></svg></button></li><li class="intentItem_iN_J"><button type="button" class="intentChip_Xc08" aria-pressed="false">Query the chain<svg class="infoDot_Rp8K" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="13" height="13" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="4.7" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle><rect x="7.2" y="6.8" width="1.6" height="4.8" rx="0.8" fill="currentColor"></rect></svg></button></li><li class="intentItem_iN_J"><button type="button" class="intentChip_Xc08" aria-pressed="false">Index on-chain data<svg class="infoDot_Rp8K" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="13" height="13" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="4.7" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle><rect x="7.2" y="6.8" width="1.6" height="4.8" rx="0.8" fill="currentColor"></rect></svg></button></li><li class="intentItem_iN_J"><button type="button" class="intentChip_Xc08" aria-pressed="false">Run a node<svg class="infoDot_Rp8K" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="13" height="13" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="4.7" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle><rect x="7.2" y="6.8" width="1.6" height="4.8" rx="0.8" fill="currentColor"></rect></svg></button></li><li class="intentItem_iN_J"><button type="button" class="intentChip_Xc08" aria-pressed="false">Integrate a wallet<svg class="infoDot_Rp8K" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="13" height="13" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="4.7" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle><rect x="7.2" y="6.8" width="1.6" height="4.8" rx="0.8" fill="currentColor"></rect></svg></button></li><li class="intentItem_iN_J"><button type="button" class="intentChip_Xc08" aria-pressed="false">Operate a pool<svg class="infoDot_Rp8K" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="13" height="13" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="4.7" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle><rect x="7.2" y="6.8" width="1.6" height="4.8" rx="0.8" fill="currentColor"></rect></svg></button></li></ul></div></section><div class="controlsSticky_ZEbO"><section class="container controls_N4KL"><div class="searchInputWrap_aX2A"><input id="searchbar" class="searchInput_x62V" placeholder="Search builder tools..." value=""></div><div class="controlsRight_cEiW"><div class="wrap_bEMJ"><button type="button" class="toggle_yJrU" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="tools-filter-panel">Filter</button></div><label class="sortLabel_ldoH"><span class="sortLabelText_QP7c">Sort</span><select class="sortSelect_HhHY"><option value="featured" selected="">Featured</option><option value="alphabetical">A to Z</option></select></label></div></section></div><section class="container section_tfqo"><header class="sectionHeader_Afkg"><h2 class="sectionTitle_qfFA">Recently added</h2><span class="sectionSubtitle_nyt1">The newest tools in the directory</span></header><div class="carousel_j5Hh" aria-label="Recently added" role="region"><button type="button" class="arrow_dVwT" disabled="" aria-label="Previous"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.41 7.41 14 6l-6 6 6 6 1.41-1.41L10.83 12z"></path></svg></button><ul class="scroller_PESt"><li class="item_j9vf"><a class="tile_c841" href="/tools/hydra-sdk/"><div class="header_EVO9"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconTile_Xnqt" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/vtechcom.png" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span></div><h3 class="title_VMhy">hydra-sdk</h3><p class="description_gDVB">TypeScript SDK for building wallet apps on Hydra, with Head lifecycle management, transaction building inside a Head, and WASM bindings for browser and Node.</p><div class="meta_nlIc"><span class="category_DA3W">SDKs &amp; Libraries</span><span class="property_EBAu">TypeScript</span></div></a></li><li class="item_j9vf"><a class="tile_c841" href="/tools/plutus-halo2-verifier-gen/"><div class="header_EVO9"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconTile_Xnqt" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/input-output.png" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span></div><h3 class="title_VMhy">plutus-halo2-verifier-gen</h3><p class="description_gDVB">Generates on-chain verifiers in Plinth or Aiken from a Rust Halo2 circuit, so its zero-knowledge proofs can be verified inside Cardano validators.</p><div class="meta_nlIc"><span class="category_DA3W">Smart Contracts</span><span class="property_EBAu">Rust</span><span class="property_EBAu">Haskell</span></div></a></li><li class="item_j9vf"><a class="tile_c841" href="/tools/gnark-cardano/"><div class="header_EVO9"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconTile_Xnqt" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/logical-mechanism.png" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span></div><h3 class="title_VMhy">gnark-cardano</h3><p class="description_gDVB">Pipeline for writing Groth16 zero-knowledge circuits in Go with gnark and verifying them on-chain with a generic Aiken verifier.</p><div class="meta_nlIc"><span class="category_DA3W">Smart Contracts</span><span class="property_EBAu">Go</span><span class="property_EBAu">Python</span></div></a></li><li class="item_j9vf"><a class="tile_c841" href="/tools/cardanokit/"><div class="header_EVO9"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconTile_Xnqt" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/cardano-kit.png" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span></div><h3 class="title_VMhy">CardanoKit</h3><p class="description_gDVB">Swift library for building Cardano wallets and signing transactions in iOS and macOS apps, with HD wallet and address support built on the Cardano Serialization Library.</p><div class="meta_nlIc"><span class="category_DA3W">SDKs &amp; Libraries</span><span class="property_EBAu">Swift</span></div></a></li><li class="item_j9vf"><a class="tile_c841" href="/tools/cardano-node/"><div class="header_EVO9"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconTile_Xnqt" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/intersect.png" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span></div><h3 class="title_VMhy">cardano-node</h3><p class="description_gDVB">The Cardano node maintained by IntersectMBO: validates the chain, produces blocks, and serves the node-to-node and node-to-client protocols.</p><div class="meta_nlIc"><span class="category_DA3W">Nodes &amp; Clients</span><span class="property_EBAu">Haskell</span></div></a></li></ul><button type="button" class="arrow_dVwT" disabled="" aria-label="Next"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8.59 16.59 10 18l6-6-6-6-1.41 1.41L13.17 12z"></path></svg></button><div class="dots_JpDw" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dot_hb_E dotActive_WVVs"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span></div></div></section><section class="container guidedPathsBanner_ybh0"><div class="guidedPathsHeader_ZifO"><h2 class="guidedPathsTitle_gMJn">Guided paths</h2><span class="guidedPathsSubtitle_WU30">Step-by-step on the Developer Portal</span></div><ul class="guidedPathChipList_OLS8"><li><a class="guidedPathChip_QkdI" href="/docs/developers/">Get started</a></li><li><a class="guidedPathChip_QkdI" href="/docs/developers/curriculum/smart-contracts/overview/">Write smart contracts</a></li><li><a class="guidedPathChip_QkdI" href="/docs/developers/curriculum/native-tokens/overview/">Create native tokens</a></li><li><a class="guidedPathChip_QkdI" href="/docs/operators/">Run a stake pool</a></li></ul></section><section class="container section_tfqo"><header class="sectionHeader_Afkg"><h2 class="sectionTitle_qfFA">Browse tools by category</h2><span class="sectionSubtitle_nyt1">A taste of each category. Maintainer picks first, then a sample of the rest.</span></header><div class="carousel_xzwC" aria-label="Browse tools by category" role="region"><button type="button" class="arrow_W4Y7" disabled="" aria-label="Previous"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.41 7.41 14 6l-6 6 