><h3 class="title_VMhy">Yaci Store</h3><p class="description_gDVB">Modular Java indexer for Cardano with pluggable stores you enable as needed, plugin-based filtering, Blockfrost-compatible REST APIs, and Parquet analytics exports.</p><div class="meta_nlIc"><span class="category_DA3W">Indexers &amp; Data</span><span class="property_EBAu">REST</span><span class="property_EBAu">Java</span></div></a></li></ul><button type="button" class="arrow_dVwT" disabled="" aria-label="Next"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8.59 16.59 10 18l6-6-6-6-1.41 1.41L13.17 12z"></path></svg></button><div class="dots_JpDw" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dot_hb_E dotActive_WVVs"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span><span class="dot_hb_E"></span></div></div></section><section class="container section_tfqo sectionMuted_DifL"><header class="sectionHeader_Afkg"><h2 class="sectionTitle_qfFA sectionTitleMuted_dFf1">Utilities &amp; more</h2><span class="sectionSubtitle_nyt1">IDEs, testing, security, and operator tooling.</span></header><div class="carousel_xzwC" aria-label="Utilities &amp; more" role="region"><button type="button" class="arrow_W4Y7" disabled="" aria-label="Previous"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.41 7.41 14 6l-6 6 6 6 1.41-1.41L10.83 12z"></path></svg></button><ul class="scroller_rkvY"><li class="item_Rzh4"><article class="panel_AM7D"><header class="panelHeader_Wh00"><h3 cla