urity and configuration compliance.</p></div><div class="metaRight_r1no"></div></a></li><li><a class="row_gyww" href="/tools/mithril/"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconRow_ethN icon_A2NQ" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/mithril.png" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span><div class="content_Y62m"><h4 class="title_KDiP">Mithril</h4><p class="description_JwSE">Stake-based protocol for fast node bootstrapping and lightweight blockchain certification.</p></div><div class="metaRight_r1no"></div></a></li></ul></article></li><li class="item_Rzh4"><article class="panel_AM7D"><header class="panelHeader_Wh00"><h3 class="panelTitle_XewX">Testing &amp; Debugging</h3><a class="seeAll_boOb" href="/tools/?tags=testing">See all</a></header><ul class="panelList_q3ce"><li><a class="row_gyww" href="/tools/lace-anatomy/"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconRow_ethN icon_A2NQ" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/txpipe.png" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span><div class="content_Y62m"><h4 class="title_KDiP">Lace Anatomy<span class="pickStar_D9fI" aria-label="Maintainer pick">★</span></h4><p class="description_JwSE">Web tool that decodes and visualizes Cardano addresses, CBOR, and transactions.</p></div><div class="metaRight_r1no"></div></a></li><li><a class="row_gyww" href="/tools/gastronomy/"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconRow_ethN icon_A2NQ" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/sundaeswap.jpg" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span><div class="content_Y62m"><h4 class="title_KDiP">Gastronomy<span class="pickStar_D9fI" aria-label="Maintainer pick">★</span></h4><p class="description_JwSE">UPLC debugger that steps forward and backward through smart contract execution.</p></div><div class="metaRight_r1no"></div></a></li><li><a class="row_gyww" href="/tools/cardano-dev-wallet/"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconRow_ethN icon_A2NQ" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/cardano-dev-wallet.png" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span><div class="content_Y62m"><h4 class="title_KDiP">Cardano Dev Wallet</h4><p class="description_JwSE">Browser-extension Cardano wallet for developers, with CIP-30 logging and custom-network support.</p></div><div class="metaRight_r1no"></div></a></li><li><a class="row_gyww" href="/tools/sorbet/"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconRow_ethN icon_A2NQ" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/sundaeswap.jpg" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span><div class="content_Y62m"><h4 class="title_KDiP">Sorbet</h4><p class="description_JwSE">Browser-extension mock wallet for testing dApp CIP-30 integrations as the end user.</p></div><div class="metaRight_r1no"></div></a></li><li><a class="row_gyww" href="/tools/datum-explorer/"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconRow_ethN icon_A2NQ" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/datum-explorer.png" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span><div class="content_Y62m"><h4 class="title_KDiP">Datum Explorer</h4><p class="description_JwSE">Decodes Cardano CBOR datums into human-readable fields using CDDL schemas.</p></div><div class="metaRight_r1no"></div></a></li></ul></article></li><li class="item_Rzh4"><article class="panel_AM7D"><header class="panelHeader_Wh00"><h3 class="panelTitle_XewX">Developer Environments</h3><a class="seeAll_boOb" href="/tools/?tags=dev-env">See all</a></header><ul class="panelList_q3ce"><li><a class="row_gyww" href="/tools/yaci-devkit/"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconRow_ethN icon_A2NQ" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/yaci-devkit.png" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span><div class="content_Y62m"><h4 class="title_KDiP">Yaci DevKit<span class="pickStar_D9fI" aria-label="Maintainer pick">★</span></h4><p class="description_JwSE">Spin up a local Cardano devnet in seconds, with a built-in indexer, explorer, and Blockfrost-compatible APIs.</p></div><div class="metaRight_r1no"></div></a></li><li><a class="row_gyww" href="/tools/intelliada/"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconRow_ethN icon_A2NQ" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/intelliada.avif" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span><div class="content_Y62m"><h4 class="title_KDiP">IntelliADA</h4><p class="description_JwSE">IntelliJ IDEA plugin for Cardano: accounts, transfers, minting, and transaction inspection from the IDE.</p></div><div class="metaRight_r1no"></div></a></li><li><a class="row_gyww" href="/tools/frankenwallet/"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconRow_ethN icon_A2NQ" aria-hidden="true"><span class="fallback_oCeI" style="background-color:#3742fa">F</span></span><div class="content_Y62m"><h4 class="title_KDiP">Frankenwallet</h4><p class="description_JwSE">Guide for building an encrypted, air-gapped setup for offline Cardano transaction signing and key backup.</p></div><div class="metaRight_r1no"></div></a></li><li><a class="row_gyww" href="/tools/demeter/"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconRow_ethN icon_A2NQ" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/demeter.png" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span><div class="content_Y62m"><h4 class="title_KDiP">Demeter</h4><p class="description_JwSE">Managed Cardano infrastructure and cloud workspaces for building dApps, with hosted Ogmios and Kupo endpoints.</p></div><div class="metaRight_r1no"></div></a></li></ul></article></li><li class="item_Rzh4"><article class="panel_AM7D"><header class="panelHeader_Wh00"><h3 class="panelTitle_XewX">Integration &amp; Middleware</h3><a class="seeAll_boOb" href="/tools/?tags=integration">See all</a></header><ul class="panelList_q3ce"><li><a class="row_gyww" href="/tools/cardano-rosetta-java/"><span class="appIcon_Zwl7 appIconRow_ethN icon_A2NQ" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/tools/cardano-logo.png" alt="" class="image_CvRN" loading="lazy"></span><div class="content_Y62m"><h4 class="title_KDiP">cardano-rosetta-java</h4><p class="description_JwSE">Java implementation of the Coinbase Mesh (Rosetta) API for Cardano, built on Yaci Store.</p></div><div class="metaRight_r1no"></div></a></li><li><a class="ro